redits, including works for NiziU, Show Lo, Yao Chen, JO1, Nexz, and Modyssey, as well as collaborations with artists such as Lil Durk, Sky-Hi, Tiger JK, and Lisa.","title":"Han (musician)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_%28musician%29"}},"Q61770150":{"id":"Q61770150","name":"Jeong Yoon-hye","ko":"정윤혜","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Yoonhye"],"birth":"2001-10-04","death":"","birthplace":"South Korea","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q60643800","name":"Fanatics","start":"2018","end":""},{"id":"Q60992623","name":"Flavor","start":"2018","end":""}],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q6854182":{"id":"Q6854182","name":"Moon Joon-young","ko":"문준영","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Moon Jun-young"],"birth":"1989-02-09","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","model"],"debut":"2010","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q483626","name":"ZE:A","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/zeafter/","x":"https://x.com/ZEA_leader","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoodEeAXp5mWWgtNCvfLKtg"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Moon Joon-young, is a South Korean singer, actor, and model. He debuted as member of boy group ZE:A. He also appeared in dramas Poseidon, Vampire Idol and The Clinic for Married Couples: Love and War. He also appeared in films such as Ronin Pop and ZE:A Breathe.","title":"Moon Joon-young","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moon_Joon-young"}},"Q97575718":{"id":"Q97575718","name":"추혁진","ko":"","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1992-02-28","death":"","birthplace":"","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q24856806","name":"A.cian","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/chustarisborn/"},"photo":null,"bio":null}}}